#import pygame.gfxdraw as gfxdraw

Feature			pygame.draw	||	pygame.gfxdraw
================================================================

Speed	 ->		Fast			Slightly slower
Quality	 ->		Pixelated edges		Smooth, antialiased edges
Precision->		Integer-only positions	Supports subpixel precision
Extras	 ->		Basic shapes		Extra shapes (like filled circles with outlines)

