# order of layers:

back_back_sprites.draw(screen)   # farthest layer
back_front_sprites.draw(screen)  # behind player
all_sprites.draw(screen)         # main gameplay layer
front_sprites.draw(screen)       # in front of everything else

front_sprites       ← UI, effects, maybe foreground grass
all_sprites         ← player, enemies, collectibles
back_front_sprites  ← bridges hidden until player is behind a wall  
back_back_sprites   ← bridges behind water, always behind everything  distant background

